    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation&nbsp;<math><mi>p</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the determinant <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
