  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">px</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">qx</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Applying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></